Independence
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The request and response shape of this project's decision API follows
TypeSafe's publicly documented Jev interface so that callers can reuse a
familiar payload shape. This project is independent software. It is not
affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by TypeSafe, and it makes no claim
of parity with any TypeSafe product. TypeSafe and Jev are the marks of their
respective owner and are used here only to describe that lineage.

SemIf is an unrelated open-source project. This repository implements a
compatible JSONL row shape as a caller convenience, vendors none of its code,
and is not affiliated with or endorsed by it. The name is used only to identify
that row format.
